#p-1-end
(prize *)
(* available in act 1) (any other prize is taken) %% Ensure at least $1,000 is taken first
(* requires 7 turns)
(name *) wifi router
(prize conversation about *)
	(div @spider) { Fantastic work. This is exactly what I need. Just attach the device I gave you and I can set to work. }
	(div @jackdaw) { hes about to say nothing is secure when someone has physical access (line) ha (line) see (line) when youre typing three sentences i can sometimes fit in one }
	(div @spider) { Well. Anyway. Regardless. Breaking this will take some time, and Jackdaw will need to stay nearby, so it will likely mean the end of our work in the wine cellar. Fox, tell me when it is time to act. }
(hack target *)
	(* is handled) %% Acquired
	(current act 1)
(perform [hack *])
	(start act two) %% world.dg

(any other prize is taken)
	*(prize $Prize)
	($Prize is handled)

