	(div @jackdaw) { i'd bet quinn }
	(div @chameleon) { But he's currently wearing his diamond cufflinks? }
	(div @jackdaw) { these are the backup pair (line) in case of emergency }

#p-2-med-tension
(prize *)
(* available in act 2/3) %% The personally-meaningful ones persist into act 3
(* requires 15 turns)
%% (* is worth 20 thousand dollars)
(name *) neon pink solid-state drive
(prize conversation about *)
	(div @chameleon) { Did you say neon pink?! }
	(div @jackdaw) { hard to miss it yeah }
	(div @chameleon) { That would be one of the Post's backup archives. It might be filled with the stories Tension crushed. Maybe even mine. Please make sure to grab that one! }
	(div @jackdaw) { consider it grabbed }

(personal treasure *)
(ending paragraph for *)
	(div @jackdaw) { we got that pink drive for chameleon (line) the stories the post buried }

#p-2-long-malatesta %% confidential patient data for class action lawsuit
(prize *)
(* available in act 2/3)
(* requires 17 turns)
%% (* is worth 30 thousand dollars)
(name *) folder full of patient records
(prize conversation about *)
	(div @spider) { Patient records? }
	(div @jackdaw) { confidential health data }
	(div @spider) { Surely you do not intend to sell that to the highest bidder? }
	(div @jackdaw) { no (line) i was listening to rat (line) nobody ever managed to take malatesta to court right? ndas and lack of evidence? }
	(div @rat) { Proof? Proof has been found? Usable in class actions? }
	(div @jackdaw) { maybe! only one way to find out }

(ending paragraph for *)
	(div @rat) { The data. Files. Records of patients. Proof for courts. }

#p-2-long-constantine
(prize *)
(* available in act 2/3)
(* requires 17 turns)
(* is worth 30 thousand dollars)
(name *) bundle of property deeds
(prize conversation about *)
	(div @chameleon) { Does Quinn just carry those around with him? }
	(div @spider) { I suppose he must want to keep them secure. Under New Gothenburg law, whoever holds the deed owns the property. }
	(div @jackdaw) { actually selling any of this is going to be hard (line) but there's one i'm hoping is in here especially }

(personal treasure *)
(ending paragraph for *)
	(div @jackdaw) { the deed to my old business }

#p-2-end
(prize *)
(* available in act 2)
(* requires 20 turns)
(name *) thermostat
(prize conversation about *)
	(div @spider) { Fantastic. Well done, Jackdaw. }
	(div @chameleon) { A thermostat? What's so fantastic about that? }
	(div @jackdaw) { iot }
	(div @spider) { It is connected to the mansion's internet-of-things network. Through it I can access the mansion's other devices and systems—which will let me add you to the guest list and forge an invitation. }
	(div @chameleon) { That (span @italic) is fantastic! I retract my comments. I will prepare for my entrance! }
	(div @jackdaw) { don't prepare too soon (line) knowing spider i'm going to be holding this thing for another half hour }
	(div @spider) { I will try to have it done in twenty. }
	(div @chameleon) { Well then, Fox, give the signal at your pleasure. }
(hack target *)
	(* is handled)
	(current act 2)
(perform [hack *])
	(start act three) %% world.dg

